					Id.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					559
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <i>difficult</i>, c. inf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακρίνειν . . δυσπαλές [ἐστι</span>] <i><span class="en">
